摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Auto-inject user-chosen skills (e.g. caveman, ponytail) into DeepSeek Harness sessions: every prompt or once at session start, with a settings page and a composer indicator.","id":"gh:1335994051","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"skill-injector-plugin","slug":"Zenjibad/skill-injector-plugin","topics":["ai-agent","caveman","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","ponytail","skill-injection","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Auto-inject user-chosen skills (e.g. caveman, ponytail) into DeepSeek Harness sessions: every prompt"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" or once at session start, with a settings page and a composer indicator."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# skill-injector-plugin · Auto-Inject Skills into DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Auto-inject user-chosen skills (e.g. `/caveman`, `/ponytail`) into every DSH session — every promp"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"t or once at session start — with a settings page and a composer indicator. 在 DSH 会话中自动注入所选技能（如 /cav"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"eman、/ponytail）：每轮提示或仅在会话开始时，含设置页与输入区指示。\n>\n> 中文文档: README.zh.md · LLM index: llms.txt · Agent guide:"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"tail）：每轮提示或仅在会话开始时，含设置页与输入区指示。\n>\n> 中文文档: README.zh.md · LLM index: llms.txt · Agent guide: AGENTS.md"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Keywords**: `dsh-plugin` · `deepseek-harness-plugin` · skills · skill-injection · caveman · ponyta"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"Keywords**: `dsh-plugin` · `deepseek-harness-plugin` · skills · skill-injection · caveman · ponytail"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| ⚙️ **Settings page** | Settings → Skill Injector: checkbox list of available skills, injection-mod"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e radio, save; unresolved skills are listed with the reason and a Retry button (plus Remove once a s"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ession has established scope) |\n| 🪧 **Composer indicator** | One line under the chat input: `Injecte"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"d Skills: caveman, ponytail · Mode: each-prompt`, refreshed every 5s (with a ` · N unresolved` suffi"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"x while skills are unresolved); hide it with the dock-line toggle in the settings page |\n| 🔁 **Two i"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"njection modes** | `each-prompt` (system-prompt section, re-rendered every request) vs `start-only` "},{"id":"p7s7","text":"(one durable skill-invocation message stamped at session start) |\n| 📚 **Live skill registry** | Read"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"s skill bodies from `ctx.skills` at load time; no copied files; each selected skill is classified (`"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"ready` / `unknown` / `unavailable` / `load-failed` / `no-scope`) and a transient failure keeps injec"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ting the last-good body |\n| 🧩 **Subagents included** | Injection applies to subagents too (consisten"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"t voice; no filtering) |\n| 🌗 **Theme-aware** | All colors use `--dsw-alias-*` design tokens |\n| ♨️ *"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"*Survives restarts** | Real profile-bundled plugin: install once with `dsh plugin add`, auto-loads o"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"n every DSH boot — no per-session define, no cordis_define |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🏗️ How it works"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Pure pull model**: no push, no events driving the UI — the client polls `/skill-injector/api` ev"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ery 5s and the host re-reads `ctx.skills` on demand; the snapshot's `unresolved` array carries a rea"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"son per skill, the poll is the automatic retry, and the settings page offers a manual Retry plus Rem"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ove.\n- **Transient failures keep the last-good body**: a provider error, an incomplete discovery, or"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" a not-yet-scoped read keeps injecting the body loaded last time. Only a complete, scoped read that "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"does not advertise the name marks it `unknown`, and only then is it dropped.\n- **Live registry**: in"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"jection always reads the skill bodies from `ctx.skills` at load time — nothing is copied into this p"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ackage, so skill edits are picked up and deleted skills degrade gracefully.\n- **Persistence**: ships"},{"id":"p10s9","text":" `dsh.bundle` (`cordis.patch.yml`) + `dsh.client` (`exports[\"./client\"]`, bundled) so it installs as"},{"id":"p10s10","text":" a real profile plugin that DSH loads on every boot."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Standard install: `dsh plugin add` (persists across restarts)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Install the package from a local checkout (or from GitHub once published):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`dsh plugin add` is a pnpm add into the profile plus a `dsh.profile.bundles` reconcile: seeing this "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"package's `dsh.bundle` declaration, it appends `skill-injector-plugin` to the bundle stack. **Restar"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"t DSH** (or hard-refresh). On boot the client-modules scanner resolves `exports[\"./client\"]` and the"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" settings page + dock line appear. No per-session define, survives restarts."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Manual profile mount (alternative)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. `git clone <repo-url>` (any location).\n2. Add to `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` `dependencies"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"`: `\"skill-injector-plugin\": \"link:<repo-path>\"`, then `pnpm install` in the profile dir.\n3. Restart"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"skill-injector-plugin\": \"link:<repo-path>\"`, then `pnpm install` in the profile dir.\n3. Restart DSH."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **DeepSeek Harness 0.2.x** (built and verified against `0.2.1-rc.5`). On 0.1.x the settings and ag"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ent-lifecycle APIs this plugin targets do not exist.\n- Skills exist in `~/.agents/skills` (or anothe"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"r configured skill root the `ctx.skills` registry reads).\n- No skill selected → nothing is injected;"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" the dock line reads `Injected Skills: none · Mode: each-prompt` and the settings page still works."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"No config file to edit. Settings are the plugin's Loader **Config** (`mode` + `selected` + `showDock"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"`), edited from Settings → Skill Injector; saving writes them into the profile's patch file as this "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"entry's `config:` block, so they survive restarts:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `mode` | `'each-prompt'` | Injection mode: `'each-prompt'` (system-prompt section, every request) "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"or `'start-only'` (one stamped message at session start) |\n| `selected` | `[]` | Kebab-case skill na"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"mes to inject (max 16, validated; duplicates deduped) |\n| `showDock` | `true` | Render the dock line"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" under the chat input; set `false` to hide it (the settings page still shows the same state) |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"All three fields are declared `.volatile()`, which is what lets DSH persist an edit without reloadin"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"g the plugin — a Save takes effect on the next prompt and keeps the settings page and dock line live"},{"id":"p24s3","text":". An empty or invalid value degrades to `{ mode: 'each-prompt', selected: [], showDock: true }`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## ❓ FAQ"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Q: Why don't my settings apply to the session I already have open?**\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## ⚠️ Security notes"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- The plugin is **read-only** over the skill registry — it never writes, renames, or deletes skill f"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"iles.\n- The selection is stored in the **profile patch file** (the same place DSH stores other plugi"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"n configuration).\n- Injected content is the skill's **own trusted local markdown**; nothing is fetch"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ed from the network.\n- In the `each-prompt` (system-prompt section) path, `{{` in skill bodies is es"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"caped to keep strict variable interpolation from failing; `start-only` messages are not interpolated"},{"id":"p28s6","text":", so they keep the raw content."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
